{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，好紧张，好紧张啊。\\n　安洁是明白的，心里是很清楚的」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「唔，好紧张，好紧张啊。　安洁是明白的，心里是很清楚的」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0311", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是可不能一直闭着眼睛，这么走下去该撞在墙上了。\\n　所以大家一二三一起……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "「但是可不能一直闭着眼睛，这么走下去该撞在墙上了。　所以大家一二三一起……」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0312", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，安洁你排名提高了」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0761", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学，你这是偷跑！\\n　安洁还没做好心理准备啊！」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "「爱理同学，你这是偷跑！　安洁还没做好心理准备啊！」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0313", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是假期结束的第一天，也是公布成绩的日子。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因此，安洁领着大家来看走廊里贴着的排名表。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "因此，安洁领着大家来看走廊里贴着的排名表。", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是因为自己来看成绩太害怕了才叫上大家一起来的嘛～\\n　一大早上就来暴击安洁的玻璃心，爱理同学太过分啦！」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "「就是因为自己来看成绩太害怕了才叫上大家一起来的嘛～　一大早上就来暴击安洁的玻璃心，爱理同学太过分啦！」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 54, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0314", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说大家都已经在看了啊」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0762", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……排名比预期还要好很多……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名的指导成果立竿见影，成绩好得不由让我都觉得一怔。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "濑名的指导成果立竿见影，成绩好得不由让我都觉得一怔。", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾脑子这么好的嘛？\\n　和你比起来我这简直是完败啊～」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "「小乾脑子这么好的嘛？　和你比起来我这简直是完败啊～」", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0166", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不是当然的嘛，区区男人还想胜过我，真是不知天高地厚！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「那不是当然的嘛，区区男人还想胜过我，真是不知天高地厚！」", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0113", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是但是纱纱输给了新吾同学哟♪」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "「但是但是纱纱输给了新吾同学哟♪」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0315", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔！」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0114", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且安洁的排名也实实在在地提高了……\\n　啊啊，谢谢你爱理同学……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「而且安洁的排名也实实在在地提高了……　啊啊，谢谢你爱理同学……」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0316", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生你这混蛋，既然是男人就老老实实把工口塞满脑子，\\n　然后把英语单词忘掉得了……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「瓜生你这混蛋，既然是男人就老老实实把工口塞满脑子，　然后把英语单词忘掉得了……」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0115", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，大家好～」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0202", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜！」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0069", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀呀，美羽同学、樱乃同学还有熊喵」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0317", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到其他年级的天羽学姐和樱乃都过来了，安洁和乾同学因为不同的原因不约而同地欢脱了起来。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "看到其他年级的天羽学姐和樱乃都过来了，安洁和乾同学因为不同的原因不约而同地欢脱了起来。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请看请看，安洁的排名上升了哟。\\n　这样就再不能有人说安洁是笨蛋美人啦，\\n　安洁已经成了让人无可指摘的完美女仆啦！♪」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "「请看请看，安洁的排名上升了哟。　这样就再不能有人说安洁是笨蛋美人啦，　安洁已经成了让人无可指摘的完美女仆啦！♪」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 61, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0318", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对不起美羽学姐。我败给那个混蛋工口瓜生了，\\n　但是，但是排名还是上升了的……！」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「对不起美羽学姐。我败给那个混蛋工口瓜生了，　但是，但是排名还是上升了的……！」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0116", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，有好好加油了呢。菜菜也是纱纱也是，我都知道的哦」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「嗯嗯，有好好加油了呢。菜菜也是纱纱也是，我都知道的哦」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0203", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔嗯，虽然这次有点像败乾（败犬），\\n　但是下次我会更加努力干掉他的！」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "「唔嗯，虽然这次有点像败乾（败犬），　但是下次我会更加努力干掉他的！」", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0117", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学看起来就好像是给妈妈汇报学习的女儿一样，\\n不过这话还是不要说出来为好吧。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "乾同学看起来就好像是给妈妈汇报学习的女儿一样，不过这话还是不要说出来为好吧。", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0070", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，嗯。我的成绩远超预期。樱乃怎么样？」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "「啊啊，嗯。我的成绩远超预期。樱乃怎么样？」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「挺好」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0396", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是呢，蛮不错的。诶嘿嘿」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0204", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么看来，大家在濑名家一起学习的努力都获得了相应的成果。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": "这么看来，大家在濑名家一起学习的努力都获得了相应的成果。", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽学姐虽然没有得到濑名的指导，但也一样露出了天使般的笑容。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "天羽学姐虽然没有得到濑名的指导，但也一样露出了天使般的笑容。", "plain_idx": 336, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这些都是多亏了小爱的功劳，\\n　所以就拉着小樱一起来道谢了」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": "「这些都是多亏了小爱的功劳，　所以就拉着小樱一起来道谢了」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0205", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说来，爱理的排名呢」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0397", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊那个，我并没什么……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0763", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名移开了视线，其余的所有人一起看向2年级的排名表。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "排名表最上边的一行字熠熠生辉——“１　濑名爱理(2-T)”。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "排名表最上边的一行字熠熠生辉——“１　濑名爱理(2-T)”。", "plain_idx": 345, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「依旧蝉联榜首，威严不容质疑！」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0319", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
