{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜～！」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0073", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「简直像是有两个小熊喵一样呢」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0207", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊……总、总之」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0767", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一说熊喵已经安在我的头上了。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不过是和平常一样罢了，\\n　不是什么值得特别褒扬的事」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "「我不过是和平常一样罢了，　不是什么值得特别褒扬的事」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0768", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难得大家兴致勃勃，这种时候泼冷水也太不解风情了吧」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "「难得大家兴致勃勃，这种时候泼冷水也太不解风情了吧」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0321", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不，虽然对濑名有些抱歉，但安洁说的也对。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然而让濑名来说的话——", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不值得为了我的成绩兴致勃勃的」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0769", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真正应该高兴的是大家的努力都取得了成果。\\n　说实话，我松了一口气，毕竟我要为你们的成绩负责嘛」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「……真正应该高兴的是大家的努力都取得了成果。　说实话，我松了一口气，毕竟我要为你们的成绩负责嘛」", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0770", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啊……大家面面相觑，逐渐明白她想说什么了。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总、总之，好好学习取得高分本来也是理所当然的事情，\\n　也不是什么特别值得褒扬的啦……」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": "「总、总之，好好学习取得高分本来也是理所当然的事情，　也不是什么特别值得褒扬的啦……」", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0771", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是由衷地为了大家的成果而感到高兴，\\n但是又拼命地压抑着自己不要表现出来。其实大家都看出来了。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": "她是由衷地为了大家的成果而感到高兴，但是又拼命地压抑着自己不要表现出来。其实大家都看出来了。", "plain_idx": 389, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "众人相视而笑。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，哼」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0772", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名红着脸别过头去。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为马上要开班会了，大家也都各自回到了教室。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "因为马上要开班会了，大家也都各自回到了教室。", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学，真的是深表感谢」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0322", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太还是一如既往的自由散漫，\\n安洁和乾同学则高高兴兴地回到了自己的座位。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": "隼太还是一如既往的自由散漫，安洁和乾同学则高高兴兴地回到了自己的座位。", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0773", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎么说，濑名，非常感谢」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也在回到座位前向濑名再次道了谢。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有你才是那个最不需要道谢的」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0774", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名把头转了过去。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『只有你』。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我清楚地知道这三个字的意义，所以即便她是这个态度我也很开心。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": "我清楚地知道这三个字的意义，所以即便她是这个态度我也很开心。", "plain_idx": 407, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且……我、我也获得了新鲜的体验」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0775", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不是很好地理解了我教你的东西吗，\\n　这种得到了良好反馈的感觉也还不错……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": "「你不是很好地理解了我教你的东西吗，　这种得到了良好反馈的感觉也还不错……」", "plain_idx": 412, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0776", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的声音里带上了一丝羞涩，\\n我也不由得直直地盯着她看起来。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": "她的声音里带上了一丝羞涩，我也不由得直直地盯着她看起来。", "plain_idx": 415, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你的这一点，我，那个，额。\\n　没什么特殊的意思啦……我就很喜欢」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": "「……你的这一点，我，那个，额。　没什么特殊的意思啦……我就很喜欢」", "plain_idx": 417, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0777", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以那个，道谢什么的就算了」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0778", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后——濑名还是移开了视线，\\n然而红晕已经染上了她的耳垂。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "最后——濑名还是移开了视线，然而红晕已经染上了她的耳垂。", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是单纯的很好教的意思啦。\\n　教学价值很高的意思，所以说啊……」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": "「就是单纯的很好教的意思啦。　教学价值很高的意思，所以说啊……」", "plain_idx": 425, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0779", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名，那个」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么啦？！」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0780", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还能再继续教我学习吗？」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不由得说出了这样的话。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也许是因为她营造出了让我不禁想提出这种要求的氛围吧。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0142", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar1146", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的回应中似乎带着些难言的喜悦——\\n希望不是我的错觉吧。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": "她的回应中似乎带着些难言的喜悦——希望不是我的错觉吧。", "plain_idx": 438, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……哈……安洁要不行了，\\n　虽然期中考试的结果还不错，所以一下子燃起了斗志，\\n　但是这种气势根本没法维持到期末……」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": "「哈……哈……安洁要不行了，　虽然期中考试的结果还不错，所以一下子燃起了斗志，　但是这种气势根本没法维持到期末……」", "plain_idx": 440, "len": 62, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0323", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你呀，做事都有一下没一下，完全不考虑节奏的……」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0783", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在是第三节课之后的课间，\\n我们刚刚在理科教室上完课，走在回教室的路上。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": "现在是第三节课之后的课间，我们刚刚在理科教室上完课，走在回教室的路上。", "plain_idx": 445, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，爱～理」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0057", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……母亲」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0784", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～♪～～♪」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0058", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长突然出现，朝众人大致打了一下招呼后，\\n便兴奋地朝濑名这边走了过来。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": "校长突然出现，朝众人大致打了一下招呼后，便兴奋地朝濑名这边走了过来。", "plain_idx": 455, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兰华校长好像很高兴呢」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0324", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为看了成绩单啦♪」", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0059", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说安洁复活的也是够快的」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理又是首席呢～嗯，有好好地在努力呢」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": "「爱理又是首席呢～嗯，有好好地在努力呢」", "plain_idx": 461, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0060", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哼」", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0785", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与高兴的校长相对的，濑名不耐烦地发出了哼的一声鼻音。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": "与高兴的校长相对的，濑名不耐烦地发出了哼的一声鼻音。", "plain_idx": 465, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「托您洪福我没有大意。还有别的事吗？」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": "「托您洪福我没有大意。还有别的事吗？」", "plain_idx": 466, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0786", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么厉害的话稍稍放松一下也没问题的。\\n　总是绷得太紧的话弦可是很容易断的喔？」", "text_idx": 468, "plain": "「这么厉害的话稍稍放松一下也没问题的。　总是绷得太紧的话弦可是很容易断的喔？」", "plain_idx": 469, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0061", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，安洁现在对这话深有体会」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0325", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「放松过一次的弦就再也没法拿来用了。\\n　我是这么想的，也一直为了避免这种情况在做着努力」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": "「放松过一次的弦就再也没法拿来用了。　我是这么想的，也一直为了避免这种情况在做着努力」", "plain_idx": 474, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0787", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，从这边的话语中，\\n　感觉到了与安洁完全不同的气量……！」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": "「唔唔，从这边的话语中，　感觉到了与安洁完全不同的气量……！」", "plain_idx": 477, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0326", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来最近的安洁变得有点脆弱了，还是先好好休息恢复一下为好」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": "「看来最近的安洁变得有点脆弱了，还是先好好休息恢复一下为好」", "plain_idx": 479, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说回来——", "text_idx": 480, "plain": "话说回来——", "plain_idx": 480, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在小小的惊讶中我再次认识到了——", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "母女俩给人的印象形成了鲜明的对比，\\n她们的主张更是完全相反。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": "母女俩给人的印象形成了鲜明的对比，她们的主张更是完全相反。", "plain_idx": 483, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……期末也要加油呀♪」", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0062", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说过了，我是不会松懈的……」", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0788", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不就是让我能够独自生活的条件吗，\\n　我不会打破自己的诺言的！」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": "「这不就是让我能够独自生活的条件吗，　我不会打破自己的诺言的！」", "plain_idx": 489, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0789", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名的语气中带着些许愤怒，似乎已经不想就这个话题再聊下去了。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——我只是和平时一样而已。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": "——我只是和平时一样而已。", "plain_idx": 492, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来里边还有这样的事情啊——我和安洁对视了一眼。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": "原来里边还有这样的事情啊——我和安洁对视了一眼。", "plain_idx": 493, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0063", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到了我们的神情，校长一瞬间瞪大了眼睛，\\n很快嘴角又浮现出一抹笑意。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": "看到了我们的神情，校长一瞬间瞪大了眼睛，很快嘴角又浮现出一抹笑意。", "plain_idx": 496, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小新吾和安洁也都知道你自己生活的事了吧」", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0064", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔～这样，诶嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0065", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我最讨厌你这样的笑法了！」", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0790", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走吧瓜生，安洁。抱歉浪费你们的时间了……」", "text_idx": 503, "plain": "「走吧瓜生，安洁。抱歉浪费你们的时间了……」", "plain_idx": 503, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0791", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶。啊，是。遵命」", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0327", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我们就先告辞了，校长」", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，嗯，回头见啦，“瓜生”♪」", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0066", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……！」", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0792", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一直持续到最后一刻的紧张气氛中，校长和濑名分道扬镳。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": "在一直持续到最后一刻的紧张气氛中，校长和濑名分道扬镳。", "plain_idx": 512, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我朝着濑名追了上去——", "text_idx": 513, "plain": "我朝着濑名追了上去——", "plain_idx": 513, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我终于是稍稍了解了一些这对母女之间对抗气场的来龙去脉，\\n但是也就到此为止不能去刨根问底了。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": "我终于是稍稍了解了一些这对母女之间对抗气场的来龙去脉，但是也就到此为止不能去刨根问底了。", "plain_idx": 515, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我越过安洁，走到濑名的身边。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——她此时正紧咬着下唇。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": "——她此时正紧咬着下唇。", "plain_idx": 517, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然还是不要刨根问底为好。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
